      en: ["Akieni is located on the banks of the strategically important Lekoni River.", "The town maintains a regional airstrip suitable for small aircraft.", "Agriculture, especially cassava production, is the primary economic sector.", "Akieni serves as a key supply center in the east of Haut-Ogooué.", "The town is famous for being near the spectacular Lekoni Canyons.", "The area experiences a drier climate due to the Batéké Plateau's proximity."],
